{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source of the Nile - digital edition</strong> is designed to be an educational and challenging game in which players compete with nature. Luck tends to be a major element in the game but can be overcome by careful play. Because the game situation is forever changing, there is no single best strategy; however, players must weigh risks against gains with every decision they make and good judgment will pay off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played on a hexagon-grid map showing Africa from Khartoum to Capetown and Lagos to Mombasa. The periphery of this map, showing the territory known ca. 1820, is filled in; the interior is blank and ready to be explored by the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This game enables you to follow the great 19th century explorers in their search for the source of the Nile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Terrain, native tribes and other discoveries are semi-randomly determined, with allowance made for previous discoveries in adjacent hexagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Meet and deal with native tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Discover mountains, jungles, deserts and great lakes in the uncharted heart of the Dark Continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Survive animal attacks, disease and starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Overcome superstition, desertion and disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The game features 481 blank hexagons ready to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK YOUR RESOLUTION AND DISPLAY SETTINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game cannot be played on resolutions lower than 1920 x 1080 and <strong>Windows display scale must be set to 100%.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following may help with ultra-wide monitors:\u00a0Right-click the game in Steam \u2192 Properties \u2192 General \u2192 Launch Options and paste this\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -force-window -windowed -w 1920 -h 1080</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is <u>HIGHLY</u> recommended that you download and read the PDF manual from the Steam store before playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI was used to assist with the production of some images.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2898060?t=1770468282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770468282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898060/6edda5ebd056de6a972ff76f0084b2c05fe6e7d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770468282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898060/6edda5ebd056de6a972ff76f0084b2c05fe6e7d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770468282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source of the Nile - digital edition</strong> is designed to be an educational and challenging game in which players compete with nature. Luck tends to be a major element in the game but can be overcome by careful play. Because the game situation is forever changing, there is no single best strategy; however, players must weigh risks against gains with every decision they make and good judgment will pay off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played on a hexagon-grid map showing Africa from Khartoum to Capetown and Lagos to Mombasa. The periphery of this map, showing the territory known ca. 1820, is filled in; the interior is blank and ready to be explored by the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This game enables you to follow the great 19th century explorers in their search for the source of the Nile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Terrain, native tribes and other discoveries are semi-randomly determined, with allowance made for previous discoveries in adjacent hexagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Meet and deal with native tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Discover mountains, jungles, deserts and great lakes in the uncharted heart of the Dark Continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Survive animal attacks, disease and starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Overcome superstition, desertion and disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The game features 481 blank hexagons ready to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK YOUR RESOLUTION AND DISPLAY SETTINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game cannot be played on resolutions lower than 1920 x 1080 and <strong>Windows display scale must be set to 100%.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following may help with ultra-wide monitors:\u00a0Right-click the game in Steam \u2192 Properties \u2192 General \u2192 Launch Options and paste this\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -force-window -windowed -w 1920 -h 1080</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is <u>HIGHLY</u> recommended that you download and read the PDF manual from the Steam store before playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI was used to assist with the production of some images.</p>","developers":["Friday Night Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898060/6753a7207749ab13050884986005fdfdfc0b3d0a/header.jpg?t=1770468282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2898060/677650/a2f477ec02aca8589766393400e7fca68d713831/1750951869/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711015145","dash_h26